## Why This Is Asked
Tests tail latency and multi-service bottlenecks under realistic, mixed workloads, including cache, DB, and inter-service calls. It also probes autoscaling and feature-flag risk.

## Key Concepts
- Tail latency analysis (P95, P99) under bursty traffic
- Multi-service topology with cache and DB layers
- Backpressure and circuit-breaker strategies
- Cache-warming and data skew handling
- Autoscaling verification and feature-flag rollout

## Code Example
